    <briefdescription>
<para>GL pipeline orchestrator — mirrors <ref refid="classjuce_1_1OpenGLAppComponent" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/JUCE/docs/tagfile.xml">juce::OpenGLAppComponent</ref> with attach/detach. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Identical API to <ref refid="classjuce_1_1OpenGLAppComponent" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/JUCE/docs/tagfile.xml">juce::OpenGLAppComponent</ref>: initialise/shutdown/render virtuals, <ref refid="structshader_1_1_controller_1a3fb139ea98ddcf75a83224894a5ba4df" kindref="member">getFrameCounter()</ref>, <ref refid="structshader_1_1_controller_1a61e18f3ad9688a09aa4d4b7bbb01ccb7" kindref="member">shutdownOpenGL()</ref>. Adds attach/detach for runtime GPU/CPU switching.</para>
<para>Owned by <ref refid="classend_1_1_view" kindref="compound">end::View</ref> as a single member. View delegates all GL lifecycle to this class.</para>
<para>Owns the compiled shader programs (<ref refid="classjam_1_1Owner" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/docs/tagfile.xml">jam::Owner&lt;juce::OpenGLShaderProgram&gt;</ref>) and the uniform dispatch table (<ref refid="structjam_1_1Function_1_1Map" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/docs/tagfile.xml">jam::Function::Map&lt;juce::Identifier, void&gt;</ref>). Uses <ref refid="structshader_1_1_compiler" kindref="compound">Compiler</ref> to build programs on the GL thread during <ref refid="structshader_1_1_controller_1a9a3adad202f34ebf260ae5a025193518" kindref="member">initialise()</ref>.</para>
<para>Thread contract:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><ref refid="structshader_1_1_controller_1a261eecb70bbd676b432e328c166816f1" kindref="member">attach()</ref> / <ref refid="structshader_1_1_controller_1ac888bf835596922d42e6b530c8156670" kindref="member">detach()</ref> / <ref refid="structshader_1_1_controller_1a33e37a46958ce5de0585b76e8e451f24" kindref="member">isAttached()</ref> : MESSAGE THREAD</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>newOpenGLContextCreated / renderOpenGL / openGLContextClosing : GL THREAD </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
